    <p class="refs-title">Para profundizar</p>
    <a href="https://huggingface.co/docs/hub/eval-results" target="_blank">Hugging Face - Evaluation Results</a>
    <a href="https://huggingface.co/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro#evaluation-results" target="_blank">DeepSeek-V4-Pro - Evaluation Results</a>
    <a href="https://www.swebench.com/" target="_blank">SWE-bench</a>
  </div>
</Slide>

